> basis b : a { andp(x, y) = x & y }
> basis a : b { orp(x, y) = x | y }
> f(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = a & b | a & c | b & c
> gates f basis a max 3
gates for f: 3 input bits -> 1 output bit, basis a
  exact search stopped (cost limit at cost 3); Shannon decomposition instead:
